  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Butterfinger puppy chow is a sweet, crunchy snack made with crispy cereal coated in melted chocolate, creamy peanut butter, and powdered sugar. Crushed Butterfinger candy adds extra crunch and rich, nutty flavor to every bite. Quick to make and completely no-bake, butterfinger puppy chow is perfect for parties, movie nights, holidays, or anytime you need an easy, crowd-pleasing treat.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-butterfinger-puppy-chow\">Why You’ll Love This butterfinger puppy chow</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-butterfinger-puppy-chow\">How to Make Butterfinger Puppy Chow</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-butterfinger-puppy-chow\">Pro Tips for Making butterfinger puppy chow</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-butterfinger-puppy-chow\">How to Serve this butterfinger puppy chow</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-butterfinger-puppy-chow\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This butterfinger puppy chow</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Irresistibly crunchy and sweet—perfect for snacking!</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to make—no baking required!</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great for parties, movie nights, or just because!</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Kid-friendly and fun to make together!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-12262\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"12262\" data-servings=\"12\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div class=\"wprm-layout-column-contain