stroke-width=\"2.14929\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<path d=\"M1.50562 7.94373H11.5342\" stroke=\"var(--meadow-accent-color)\" stroke-width=\"2.14929\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<path d=\"M1.73071 2.24432H16.3691\" stroke=\"var(--meadow-accent-color)\" stroke-width=\"2.14929\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<path d=\"M1.73071 13.6622H7.77047\" stroke=\"var(--meadow-accent-color)\" stroke-width=\"2.14929\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n</svg>\n</span> Notes</a></div>\n  <div class=\"wprm-layout-column-container wprm-column-gap-40 wprm-column-rows-recipe-900 meadow-main-columns\">\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-column-width-50 meadow-main-left\">\n      <div id=\"recipe-12262-ingredients\" class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredients-container wprm-recipe-12262-ingredients-container wprm-block-text-normal wprm-ingredient-style-regular wprm-recipe-images-before\" data-recipe=\"12262\" data-servings=\"12\"><h3 class=\"wprm-recipe-header wprm-recipe-ingredients-header wprm-block-text-bold wprm-align-left wprm-header-decoration-spacer wprm-header-has-actions wprm-header-has-actions\" style=\"\">Ingredients<div class=\"wprm-decoration-spacer\"></div>&nbsp;&nbsp;</h3><div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div><div class=\"wprm-internal-container wprm-internal-container-ingredients wprm-expandable-container wprm-expandable-expanded\" style=\"\"><div class=\"wprm-internal-container-toggle\"><a role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"wprm-expandable-button wprm-expandable-button-show\" aria-label=\"Show Section\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-icon wprm-collapsible-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><g class=\"nc-icon-wrapper\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"3.5,9.5 8,5 12.5,9.5 \"></polyline></g></svg></span> </a><a role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"wprm-expandable-button wprm-expandable-button-hide\" aria-label=\"Hide Section\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-icon wprm-collapsible-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><g class=\"nc-icon-wrapper\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"3.5,6.5 8,11 12.5,6.5 \"></polyline></g></svg></span> </a></div><div class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-group\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-group-name wprm-recipe-ingredient-group-name wprm-block-text-bold\" style=\"color: var(--meadow-accent-color);\">Ingredients</div><div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 5px;\"></div><ul class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredients\"><li class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient\" style=\"list-style-type: none;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--meadow-list-border-color);padding-bottom: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;\" data-uid=\"-1\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount\">6</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit\">cups</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-name\">Rice Chex cereal</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded\">The base for your puppy chow.</span></li><li class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient\" style=\"list-style-type: none;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--meadow-list-border-color);padding-bottom: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;\" data-uid=\"-1\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount\">1</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit\">cup</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-name\">white chocolate chips</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded\">For that creamy sweetness.</span></li><li class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient\" style=\"list-style-type: none;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--meadow-list-border-color);padding-bottom: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;\" data-uid=\"-1\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount\">1/2</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit\">cup</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-name\">creamy peanut butter</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded\">Adds a rich, nutty flavor.</span></li><li class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient\" style=\"list-style-type: none;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--meadow-list-border-color);padding-bottom: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;\" data-uid=\"-1\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount\">1</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit\">teaspoon</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-name\">vanilla extract</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded\">Enhances the overall taste.</span></li><li class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient\" style=\"list-style-type: none;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--meadow-list-border-color);padding-bottom: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;\" data-uid=\"-1\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount\">1/4</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit\">teaspoon</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-name\">salt</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded\">Balances the sweetness.</span></li><li class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient\" style=\"list-style-type: none;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--meadow-list-border-color);padding-bottom: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;\" data-uid=\"-1\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount\">1 1/2</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit\">cups</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-name\">powdered sugar</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded\">For coating and sweetness.</span></li><li class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient\" style=\"list-style-type: none;\" data-uid=\"-1\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount\">2</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit\">cups</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-name\">chopped Butterfinger candy bars</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded\">The star ingredient for that signature crunch.</span></li></ul></div></div></div>\n      <div id=\"recipe-12262-equipment\" class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-container wprm-block-text-normal\" data-recipe=\"12262\"><h3 class=\"wprm-recipe-header wprm-recipe-equipment-header wprm-block-text-bold wprm-align-left wprm-header-decoration-none\" style=\"\">Equipment</h3><div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div><div class=\"wprm-internal-container wprm-internal-container-equipment wprm-expandable-container wprm-expandable-expanded\" style=\"\"><div class=\"wprm-internal-container-toggle\"><a role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"wprm-expandable-button wprm-expandable-button-show\" aria-label=\"Show Section\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-icon wprm-collapsible-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><g class=\"nc-icon-wrapper\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"3.5,9.5 8,5 12.5,9.5 \"></polyline></g></svg></span> </a><a role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"wprm-expandable-button wprm-expandable-button-hide\" aria-label=\"Hide Section\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-icon wprm-collapsible-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><g class=\"nc-icon-wrapper\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"3.5,6.5 8,11 12.5,6.5 \"></polyline></g></svg></span> </a></div><ul class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment wprm-recipe-equipment-list\"><li class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-item\" style=\"list-style-type: none;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--meadow-list-border-color);padding-bottom: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-name\">1 Microwave-safe Bowl&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-notes wprm-recipe-equipment-notes-normal\">For melting the chocolate and peanut butter mixture.</span></div></li><li class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-item\" style=\"list-style-type: none;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--meadow-list-border-color);padding-bottom: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-name\">1 Large mixing bowl&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-notes wprm-recipe-equipment-notes-normal\">For mixing the cereal and chocolate.</span></div></li><li class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-item\" style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-name\">1 Zip-top bag&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-notes wprm-recipe-equipment-notes-normal\">For shaking the cereal with powdered sugar.</span></div></li></ul></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-column-width-50 meadow-main-right\">\n      <div id=\"recipe-12262-instructions\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instructions-container wprm-recipe-12262-instructions-container wprm-block-text-normal\" data-recipe=\"12262\"><h3 class=\"wprm-recipe-header wprm-recipe-instructions-header wprm-block-text-bold wprm-align-left wprm-header-decoration-spacer wprm-header-has-actions\" style=\"\">Method<div class=\"wprm-decoration-spacer\"></div>&nbsp;</h3><div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-group\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-group-name wprm-recipe-instruction-group-name wprm-block-text-bold\" style=\"color: #000000;\">Instructions</div><div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 5px;\"></div><ol class=\"wprm-recipe-instructions\"><li id=\"wprm-recipe-12262-step-0-0\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-text\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: block;\">Step 1: Melt the Mixture &#8211; In a microwave-safe bowl, combine white chocolate chips and peanut butter. Microwave in 30-second intervals, stirring after each until the mixture is smooth and creamy.</span></div></li><li id=\"wprm-recipe-12262-step-0-1\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-text\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: block;\">Step 2: Add Flavor &#8211; Stir in the vanilla extract and a pinch of salt to enhance the flavors. Mix well until everything is combined.</span></div></li><li id=\"wprm-recipe-12262-step-0-2\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-text\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: block;\">Step 3: Coat the Cereal &#8211; Place the Chex cereal in a large mixing bowl. Pour the chocolate mixture over the cereal and gently toss to coat each piece evenly.</span></div></li><li id=\"wprm-recipe-12262-step-0-3\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-text\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: block;\">Step 4: Shake it Up &#8211; Transfer the coated cereal to a large zip-top bag. Add powdered sugar, seal the bag, and shake until the cereal is fully coated in sweetness.</span></div></li><li id=\"wprm-recipe-12262-step-0-4\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-text\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: block;\">Step 5: Add Butterfinger &#8211; Let the mixture cool briefly. Stir in the chopped Butterfinger candy pieces for that extra crunch and flavor.</span></div></li><li id=\"wprm-recipe-12262-step-0-5\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-text\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: block;\">Step 6: Serve and Enjoy! &#8211; Serve your delicious Butterfinger Puppy Chow immediately or store it in an airtight container for later. Enjoy this sweet treat with friends and family!</span></div></li></ol></div></div>\n      \n      \n      <div id=\"recipe-12262-notes\" class=\"wprm-recipe-notes-container wprm-block-text-normal\"><h3 class=\"wprm-recipe-header wprm-recipe-notes-header wprm-block-text-bold wprm-align-left wprm-header-decoration-none\" style=\"\">Notes</h3><div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div><div class=\"wprm-recipe-notes\"><table>\n<tr>\n<th>Nutrient</th>\n<th>Amount per Serving</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Calories</td>\n<td>250</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fat</td>\n<td>12g</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Protein</td>\n<td>3g</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Carbs</td>\n<td>35g</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sugar</td>\n<td>20g</td>\n</tr>\n</table></div></div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 40px;\"></div>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div></div></div>\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"ingredients\"><strong>Ingredients</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Gather these simple ingredients to create your delicious Butterfinger Puppy Chow!</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"533\" src=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Ingredients-for-Butterfinger-Puppy-Chow.webp\" alt=\"Ingredients for Butterfinger Puppy Chow displayed on a kitchen table.\" class=\"wp-image-12260\" srcset=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Ingredients-for-Butterfinger-Puppy-Chow.webp 400w, https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Ingredients-for-Butterfinger-Puppy-Chow-225x300.webp 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>6 cups Rice Chex cereal</strong> – the base for your <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Puppy_chow_(snack)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">puppy chow</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>1 cup white chocolate chips</strong> – for that creamy sweetness</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>1/2 cup creamy peanut butter</strong> – adds a rich, nutty flavor</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>1 teaspoon vanilla extract</strong> – enhances the overall taste</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>1/4 teaspoon salt</strong> – balances the sweetness</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>1 1/2 cups powdered sugar</strong> – for coating and sweetness</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>2 cups chopped Butterfinger candy bars</strong> – the star ingredient for that signature crunch</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"how-to-make-butterfinger-puppy-chow\"><strong>How to Make Butterfinger Puppy Chow</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This delightful Butterfinger Puppy Chow is a quick no-bake dessert that will have you smiling in no time! With a preparation time of just 10 minutes and no cooking required, you can whip this up in a flash. Allow it to cool for a few minutes before diving in, and you’ll have a sweet treat ready to enjoy!</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"533\" src=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Making-Butterfinger-Puppy-Chow.webp\" alt=\"Step-by-step process of making Butterfinger Puppy Chow, including melting chocolate, mixing ingredients, coating cereal, and adding Butterfinger pieces.\" class=\"wp-image-12261\" srcset=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Making-Butterfinger-Puppy-Chow.webp 400w, https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Making-Butterfinger-Puppy-Chow-225x300.webp 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 1: Melt the Mixture</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In a microwave-safe bowl, combine white chocolate chips and peanut butter. Microwave in 30-second intervals, stirring after each until the mixture is smooth and creamy.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 2: Add Flavor</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Stir in the vanilla extract and a pinch of salt to enhance the flavors. Mix well until everything is combined.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 3: Coat the Cereal</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Place the Chex cereal in a large mixing bowl. Pour the chocolate mixture over the cereal and gently toss to coat each piece evenly.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 4: Shake it Up</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Transfer the coated cereal to a large zip-top bag. Add powdered sugar, seal the bag, and shake until the cereal is fully coated in sweetness.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 5: Add Butterfinger</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Let the mixture cool briefly. Stir in the chopped Butterfinger candy pieces for that extra crunch and flavor.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 6: Serve and Enjoy!</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Serve your delicious Butterfinger Puppy Chow immediately or store it in an airtight container for later. Enjoy this sweet treat with friends and family!</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"recipe-snapshot\"><strong>Recipe Snapshot</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Category</td><td>Dessert</td></tr><tr><td>Cuisine</td><td>American</td></tr><tr><td>Prep Time</td><td>10 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Cook Time</td><td>0 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Extra Time</td><td>0 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Total Time</td><td>10 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Dietary</td><td>Vegetarian</td></tr><tr><td>Serves</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>Best Served</td><td>Immediately or stored in an airtight container</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"pro-tips-for-making-butterfinger-puppy-chow\"><strong>Pro Tips for Making butterfinger puppy chow</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Use creamy peanut butter for a smoother texture.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Coat the cereal evenly for the best flavor distribution.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Let the chocolate cool slightly before mixing to avoid sogginess.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Store in an airtight container to keep it crunchy.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Add extra crushed Butterfinger on top for a delightful crunch.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"how-to-serve-this-butterfinger-puppy-chow\"><strong>How to Serve this butterfinger puppy chow</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Serve in cute mason jars for a fun, portable treat.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Top with whipped cream for an extra creamy touch.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pair with a scoop of vanilla ice cream for a delightful dessert combo.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sprinkle with extra crushed Butterfinger for added crunch.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Use as a topping for yogurt or smoothie bowls for a sweet twist.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Package in cellophane bags for party favors or gifts.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Enjoy as a movie night snack alongside popcorn.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"make-ahead-and-storage\"><strong>Make Ahead and Storage</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You can easily prepare and store your Butterfinger Puppy Chow:</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Storing Leftovers</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Store in an airtight container.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Keep at room temperature for up to a week.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Avoid moisture to maintain crunchiness.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Freezing</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Place in a freezer-safe bag or container.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Remove as much air as possible before sealing.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can be frozen for up to 3 months.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Reheating</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>No need to reheat; enjoy straight from the container.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>If desired, let sit at room temperature for a few minutes.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>For a warm treat, microwave for 5-10 seconds.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Explore more easy <a href=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/category/breakfast/\"><strong>breakfast</strong></a> recipes, quick <a href=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/category/lunch/\"><strong>lunch</strong></a> ideas, cozy <a href=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/category/dinner/\"><strong>dinner</strong></a> meals, tasty <a href=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/category/snacks/\"><strong>snacks</strong></a>, and delightful <a href=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/category/dessert/\"><strong>dessert</strong></a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"fa-qs\"><strong>FAQs</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Here’s a helpful FAQ about this recipe:</p>\n\n\n<div id=\"rank-math-faq\" class=\"rank-math-block\">\n<div class=\"rank-math-list \">\n<div id=\"faq-question-1\" class=\"rank-math-list-item\">\n<h3 class=\"rank-math-question \"><strong>1. What is Butterfinger Puppy Chow?</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"rank-math-answer \">\n\n<p>Butterfinger Puppy Chow is a delicious no-bake dessert made with Chex cereal, melted chocolate, peanut butter, and crushed Butterfinger candy bars. It’s a sweet, crunchy treat that’s perfect for parties, snacks, or just a fun dessert at home!</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"faq-question-2\" class=\"rank-math-list-item\">\n<h3 class=\"rank-math-question \"><strong>2. How do you make Butterfinger Puppy Chow?</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"rank-math-answer \">\n\n<p>To make Butterfinger Puppy Chow, start by melting chocolate and peanut butter together. Then, pour this mixture over Chex cereal and gently stir to coat. Once coated, add crushed Butterfinger bars and toss everything together. Finally, dust with powdered sugar for a sweet finish!</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"faq-question-3\" class=\"rank-math-list-item\">\n<h3 class=\"rank-math-question \"><strong>3. Can Butterfinger Puppy Chow be customized or made gluten-free?</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"rank-math-answer \">\n\n<p>Absolutely! You can customize Butterfinger Puppy Chow by adding different types of candy or nuts. To make it gluten-free, simply use gluten-free Chex cereal and ensure that all other ingredients are certified gluten-free as well.</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"faq-question-4\" class=\"rank-math-list-item\">\n<h3 class=\"rank-math-question \"><strong>4. How should Butterfinger Puppy Chow be stored to stay fresh?</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"rank-math-answer \">\n\n<p>To keep your Butterfinger Puppy Chow fresh, store it in an airtight container at room temperature. It should stay good for about a week, but it’s so tasty that it might not last that long!</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"final-thoughts\"><strong>Final Thoughts</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Get ready to indulge in the delightful crunch of Butterfinger Puppy Chow! This easy, no-bake treat is perfect for sharing or savoring all by yourself. With just a few simple ingredients, you’ll create a nostalgic snack that’s sure to bring smiles. So grab your friends, whip up a batch, and enjoy the sweet, buttery goodness together!</p>\n",
